flowchart TD
  need[New or changed reusable primitive] --> issue[GitHub issue on mithya-ui-libs]
  issue --> impl[Implement in packages/web or packages/native]
  impl --> play[Playground review]
  play --> registry[pnpm build:registry]
  registry --> tag[Immutable git tag]
  tag --> pin[Client bumps pin in components.json]
  pin --> sync[pnpm ui:sync]
  sync --> commit[UI-only commit with UI-Reason and UI-Version]
